## Project layout

```
train.py              training entrypoint (config-driven, AMP/DDP-ready)
evaluate.py            standalone evaluation
infer.py                single-input inference
model.py                model definition
dataset.py              dataset definition
dataloader.py           DataLoader construction (DDP-aware)
losses.py               loss function(s)
metrics.py              evaluation metrics
optimizer.py            optimizer construction
scheduler.py            LR scheduler construction
config.yaml             active training configuration
configs/                additional named configuration profiles
callbacks/              checkpointing, early stopping, TensorBoard/MLflow logging
utils/                  seeding, logging, distributed-training helpers
tests/                  smoke tests for model/dataset
scripts/                convenience shell scripts
notebooks/              exploration notebook
```

## Setup

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

## Train

```bash
python train.py --config config.yaml
```

Resume from a checkpoint:

```bash
python train.py --config config.yaml --resume checkpoints/checkpoint_epoch_10.pt
```
{% if options.use_ddp %}

Multi-GPU (DistributedDataParallel):

```bash
torchrun --nproc_per_node=<NUM_GPUS> train.py --config config.yaml
```
{% endif %}

## Evaluate

```bash
python evaluate.py --config config.yaml --checkpoint checkpoints/best.pt
```

